source: crates/biome_formatter_test/src/snapshot_builder.rs
info: scss/tailwind/release-final-statement-apply.scss
---

# Input

```scss
.explicit{@apply py-3; width:1px}
.final { @apply   py-3 }
.block-comment{@apply mb-2 /* utility */ }
.line-comment{
@apply clear-both // utility
/* close */ }
.slashes{ @apply w-1/2  bg-[url(http://example.com/a.svg)] content-['/*x*/']; }
.after{width:1px}
@apply   py-3
```


# Options

```json
{
  "css": {
    "parser": {
      "tailwindDirectives": true
    }
  }
}
```

# Formatted

```scss
.explicit {
	@apply py-3;
	width: 1px;
}
.final {
	@apply py-3;
}
.block-comment {
	@apply mb-2 /* utility */;
}
.line-comment {
	@apply clear-both // utility
	/* close */;
}
.slashes {
	@apply w-1/2 bg-[url(http://example.com/a.svg)] content-['/*x*/'];
}
.after {
	width: 1px;
}
@apply py-3;

```
